# p5 usage (v0.0.16): /usage with no credential at all (the harness's
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY blanked; a blank value counts as unset). The report is
# answered and the clock pinned as in p5-usage-cached, so a read the screen
# should not make would be served and still leave its line in the gateway log;
# r on this screen too.
env AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
clock 1791819000000
usage p5-usage-report.json
models models.json
wait 3
snap start
type /usage
key Enter
wait 3
snap open
key r
wait 1.5
snap r
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap closed
gwlog
